OL,3,GNEWSAAmber warning issued as Storm
OL,4,AAusten threatens UK with strong winds
OL,5,Aand heavy rain
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Met Office has issued an amber
OL,8,Fweather warning for strong winds as
OL,9,FStorm Austen is forecast to sweep
OL,10,Facross parts of the UK.
OL,12,FThe warning - the second-highest tier
OL,13,Fthat the Met Office issues - is valid
OL,14,Ffor Cornwall and parts of west Devon
OL,15,Ffrom 03:00 until 10:00 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FWind gusts of up to 80mph (130km/h) are
OL,18,Fexpected around exposed coasts, with
OL,19,F60-70mph gusts elsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
